WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:03.310
A paper result becomes useful when you
review

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:05.890
the reasoning. Open Journal beneath the
chart.

00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:07.610
Start with the newest close.

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:10.910
Read the instrument, direction, and closed
volume together.

00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:12.290
Then inspect the result.

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:15.450
Partial closes can create separate rows
for one

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:18.430
position. Profit alone does not show
whether you

00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:19.310
followed your plan.

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:21.930
Compare what happened with the decision
you intended

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:24.710
to make. Return to your Academy lesson's
practice

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:28.190
notes. Write one thing to review next
time.

00:00:28.190 --> 00:00:31.730
Save your reflection and ask a question if
needed.

